# `vendor/` above is meant for other ecosystems' dependency-vendoring directories
# (PHP/Ruby-style); apps/web/tests/vendor/ is this project's own committed, hash-verified
# test fixture (D-25 as amended — apps/web/tests/vendor/README.md records provenance) and
# must not be caught by that blanket rule. Both the directory and its contents need an
# explicit re-include — gitignore does not descend into an already-excluded directory to
# apply a narrower negation.
!apps/web/tests/vendor/
!apps/web/tests/vendor/**

